[{"client_msg_id":"9d73ee5e-86d2-4eea-98eb-b73cc277720f","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"ここのとこAWS DX不安定でつらたん…","ts":"1620831515.041300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fgDi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ad7d511-8d1a-454b-b729-5db687bdb968","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"そしてSaaSだと思ってたAWSマネージドなサービス、DynamoDBとかRDSとかS3とかCognitoとかはPaaSなんですね。\nここらへんの用語適当にしてたから間違えて認識してた。。","ts":"1620808163.040500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4sz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84f64d42-81d9-4481-af76-403d1f1de164","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ですね。自分がAWSのSaaSサービスばかり使ってたから勘違いしてました。\nEC2はIaaSですね。","ts":"1620807484.040200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+zj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5159619f-595e-4e4d-993c-3bb744a57257","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u0026gt; 座右の銘は「こだわりは不都合を生む」","ts":"1620807409.040000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4=h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16453016-3020-44bb-9861-f9b16a58cc74","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"個人紹介カード、これ画像じゃないんだな、やるなあ","ts":"1620807396.039700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ehHa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d2ebfd6-2f74-4cd6-9720-038a8139d8a0","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"む。AWS, GCPとかの諸々は(I|P|F)aaSであってSaaSじゃない認識ですが…","ts":"1620807378.039400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kanzenrikai","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hk7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89c00bf0-4a64-48e4-8ef4-6d09bf61d745","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"エイスースではないだろうな(まぜっかえし)","ts":"1620807362.039200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"550uh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9c241b5-b6b0-4f3b-9b19-db699690331d","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"なんかかわいいブログを見つけた\n\u003chttps://www.interlink.ne.jp/lp/wadakiku/aws.html\u003e","ts":"1620807258.038000","attachments":[{"fallback":"わだちゃんが聞くよ！ by インターリンク株式会社: 『AWSってサースなの、パースなの、イアースなの？』- わだちゃんが聞くよ！ by インターリンク株式会社","id":1,"title":"『AWSってサースなの、パースなの、イアースなの？』- わだちゃんが聞くよ！ by インターリンク株式会社","title_link":"https://www.interlink.ne.jp/lp/wadakiku/aws.html","text":"わだちゃんがお絵描きで解説しちゃったよ！！「せんぱーい！ AWSってなんなの？？」「わだちゃん、それはね…」","image_url":"https://www.interlink.ne.jp/lp/wadakiku/img/aws/figure-fb.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"わだちゃんが聞くよ！ by インターリンク株式会社","service_icon":"https://www.interlink.ne.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.interlink.ne.jp/lp/wadakiku/aws.html","original_url":"https://www.interlink.ne.jp/lp/wadakiku/aws.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FcyIM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2193a4e-00a2-464a-b716-c98f7da90d1a","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"cc: \u003c@UD1FQV38V\u003e\nというかAWSはSaaSでは？って思ったので、ちょっとトピック変えたいかも。。？\nあまり良い文言が思いつかない。\n```-Cloud でも Vim がしたい！ SaaS系は #tech-web-service\n+Cloud でも Vim がしたい！ ウェブサービス系は #tech-web-service```\n同じこと2回言ってる感が。。","ts":"1620807163.036900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/LDBC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1bdb1a1-d974-4816-bf85-2f7a92ff99d3","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あ、まちがえました。`None`じゃなくて、`null`ですね。\n```cat | ruby -rjson -ryaml -e 'print YAML.load(STDIN.read).to_json'\nnull_value: #@ None\n{\"null_value\":null}```","ts":"1620806435.036200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vGrk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d086a515-5694-49e5-9cdc-94201da40cb1","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"あれ、yamlパーサ通すとnullになりませんかね？\nパーサによるのかな","ts":"1620806338.035900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0uzJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a94fb545-7012-4ea3-8723-65fe7f20f489","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"yttも\n```null_value: #@ None```\nとかはyaml validじゃないんじゃないかなと思ったんですが、値がコメントのときはNoneになるんですね。","ts":"1620806045.034800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D33="}]},{"client_msg_id":"d98c2a5f-513d-4b28-a88e-8cdc9f388d3a","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ですね。その雰囲気は感じました。うーん。。","ts":"1620805873.034200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cxh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6a62aed-d189-4800-94ba-f30c653065d0","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"jsonnet分かりづらくてあまり好きじゃない…\njson validじゃなかったりするし(個人の感想です)","ts":"1620805794.034000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1ZHM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c95a5ac-6397-434f-90f3-8efb59d23ea0","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"なるほど。CloudformationでYAMLの苦しみを味わってるので、他コミュニティでもYAML/JSON関連の資産は使っていきたいですね。。!","ts":"1620805611.032600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HF3D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41607bc2-0c0d-4211-b893-465f24015630","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"jsonnetはリッチなテンプレートエンジン的なアレですね","ts":"1620804822.032200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RSydw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc6614c3-0180-4f07-a5c0-497f8249ff3c","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/google/jsonnet\u003e\njosnnetっていうのもあるみたいです。これもk8sの文脈。。？","ts":"1620801614.030800","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: google/jsonnet","id":1,"title":"google/jso